<description>&lt;p&gt;Elders are being urged to use their influence to prevent conflict while a Sudanese official accuses Ethiopia and South Sudan of fuelling regional instability, and the election delay deepens the democratic crisis. A Christian woman was killed by her brother for trying to escape a forced marriage to a Muslim man, a boda-boda rider was shot dead by an armed passenger in Wau, and two Kapoeta youth were killed after an SSPDF arrest. Joint security talks between South Sudan and Sudan resumed in Juba, China urged the UN to lift sanctions, and the US set expectations for locally funded elections. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQNDlEbFFqNV9idmhGSWo4RzVkTFA4cTd2S01JQ1RhcTY3UU4tdTBIbVpZcnMwY3R5SkU3UDhuU1RQOHNOV2tPSndlQ0JhMERSd25zSUNQdS01VUNXeW1rWGtMUG1QNXpRVDRxSE1BdlF5V3d1VGpGWGpKMUkxX1dnRnFDRVpwc2prMk9zMWl6Tk5aSU13S1pUZ1RMemdwT0FEZXZWOQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Christian Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1pbkFIUFo0MnJCaWJMejVKbGRkZkRNZ3BVQ296Z21IU0RQZV9HVkFCbk1FRl9lekdwelRjR25ISVdCNVZnM0RwLTZTam5aUmU4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;OkayAfrica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQbmE0ZDd1cV9UbmdtRVVtNGk3cVJManFwSnFDNEZRSmNoTll4ZW1RcmZKQjhlVDVZQ2lwUGpmUUJwd2dRLUZZZ004VW9NUUt4dmZDcmNhb3RObDNIeFRrQWx6ckNDNjZkODkzaGxTQ1BjakI0N2hNZEFQYVNZRWZDbUdZOHRHbmFpNmNVMzBtZDNrRnlPUjdHbHBReEQxSEpObFFaUG1oTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pretoria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: